Hello! I'm Veronica, your technical leader. I love the idea of transforming our suite into a cinematic, high-performance **Netflix-style streaming & SaaS platform ("PulseStreamflix")**! 

To make this architecture robust, immersive, and production-grade, let's establish our technical specifications before writing code.

---

### 🏛️ Architectural Blueprint: "PulseStreamflix" Suite

#### 1. Core Objectives & Experience Design
- **Cinematic Dark Aesthetics:** Deep crimson (`#e50914`), obsidian black (`#0f1015`), immersive gradients, glowing badges, and glassmorphism headers.
- **Hero Spotlight Banner:** Auto-playing or interactive feature highlight with backdrop art, synopsis, age ratings, match percentage (e.g. `98% Match for Enterprise`), and "Stream Now" vs "View Metrics" CTAs.
- **Categorized Infinite Rows:** Horizontal scrolling carousels for "Trending Analytics", "High-Throughput DB Clusters", "Stripe Billing Masterclasses", and "AI Infrastructure".
- **Interactive Video Modal / Player Simulation:** Fullscreen immersive player view with playback controls, timeline scrubbing, resolution toggles (4K HDR / 1080p), and subtitle toggles.
- **Integrated Billing & Subscription Plans:** Netflix-inspired tier selection ("Basic 720p", "Standard 1080p", "Premium 4K Ultra") integrated with simulated Stripe Checkout.

#### 2. Component Hierarchy & State Management (`src/App.tsx`)
```text
App (Root State: activeTab, currentMovie, isPlayingModal, billingTier)
├── Navbar (Netflix red logo, search bar, notifications, user avatar)
├── HeroBanner (Featured item background poster, metadata, action buttons)
├── CategoryRow[] (Horizontal scrollable media/SaaS modules)
│   └── MediaCard (Hover zoom preview, quick stats, match score)
├── VideoPlayerModal (Fullscreen cinematic player with mock scrubbing & telemetry)
├── BillingTiersModal (Netflix-style subscription pricing cards)
└── Footer (Enterprise links, region selector, compliance badges)
```

#### 3. Data Models (`TypeScript interfaces`)
```ts
interface MediaItem {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  category: 'analytics' | 'database' | 'billing' | 'security' | 'masterclass';
  matchScore: number;
  rating: string;
  durationOrQPS: string;
  description: string;
  thumbnail: string;
  backdrop: string;
  tags: string[];
}
```

---

